{
  "title": "Nutty Spicy Peruvian Potato Stew",
  "description": "A spicy and chewy Peruvian dish featuring gruyere and tadka, perfect for a lazy Sunday, this shojin-friendly stew is a delight to the senses. It combines the richness of potatoes and cheese with the warmth of spices.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
